{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1092", "sample_idx": 32, "model_name": "meta/llama-4-maverick-17b-128e-instruct", "content": "My recent trip to Japan was a truly unforgettable experience. From the moment I arrived in Tokyo, I was struck by the city's vibrant energy and rich culture. I spent my days exploring the city's many temples and shrines, including the famous Meiji Shrine, where I marveled at the serene gardens and tranquil atmosphere.\n\nOne of the highlights of my trip was a visit to the Tsukiji Outer Market, where I sampled some of the freshest sushi I've ever had. The flavors were incredible, and the bustling atmosphere was a thrill to be in. I also took a day trip to Kyoto, where I visited the iconic Fushimi Inari shrine and hiked through the thousands of vermilion torii gates that tunnel up the mountain.\n\nAt night, I enjoyed the city's neon-lit streets, taking in the dazzling displays of Tokyo's nightlife. From karaoke bars to robot restaurants, there's no shortage of unique entertainment options in this fascinating city. I also had the chance to try some delicious street food, including yakitori and takoyaki, which were both absolutely delicious.\n\nOverall, my trip to Japan was an incredible adventure that left me with many unforgettable memories. The country's unique blend of traditional and modern culture, combined with its stunning natural beauty, made for a truly enriching experience. I'm already planning my next trip back to this amazing country.", "logprobs": [{"token": "My", "logprob": -0.46528711915016174}, {"token": " recent", "logprob": -0.00416210200637579}, {"token": " trip", "logprob": -7.152531907195225e-06}, {"token": " to", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -3.576278118089249e-07}, {"token": " was", "logprob": -8.22540732769994e-06}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.20429882407188416}, {"token": " truly", "logprob": -0.6970846652984619}, {"token": " unforgettable", "logprob": -0.00038485272671096027}, {"token": " experi